LICENSE PLACEHOLDER — DECISION DEFERRED

Copyright (c) 2025 the StateProof authors. All rights reserved.

No open-source license has been granted for this repository yet. This is a
deliberate, recorded decision rather than an oversight; see
docs/decisions/0001-foundation.md, section "Licensing".

Rationale: the competition's submission and licensing requirements govern what
license is appropriate, and choosing one before those are settled could
conflict with them. Adding a permissive license later is straightforward;
retracting one is not.

Until this file is replaced with a real license:

- Competition organisers and judges may use, run, copy and evaluate this
  repository for the purpose of judging the competition.
- No other rights are granted.

Action required before submission: replace this file with the license the
competition requires or the authors choose, and record that choice in
docs/decisions/.
